{"id":"40176d5c80238174","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-veblen-hierarchy.md","title":"Veblen 层级","display":"df-veblen-hierarchy — Veblen 层级","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-veblen-hierarchy","aliases":["18-df-veblen-hierarchy","18-df-023"],"display":"df-veblen-hierarchy — Veblen 层级","depends_on":["[[18-df-ordinal]]","[[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]","[[18-df-fixed-point-set]]","[[18-df-well-order-enumeration]]","[[18-df-normal-function]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_section":"Definition 3.4.6; Theorem 3.4.7","source_pages":"36–37","source_pdf_pages":"46–47","verification_status":"source-statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-veblen-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-veblen-hierarchy</span><span>18-df-023</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-veblen-hierarchy — Veblen 层级"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c52eb8a9d5ba532\" href=\"?note=5c52eb8a9d5ba532\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-exponentiation\">18-df-ordinal-exponentiation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"779baa2ce0d8c0d8\" href=\"?note=779baa2ce0d8c0d8\" title=\"18-df-fixed-point-set\">18-df-fixed-point-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0add8a5835559b4b\" href=\"?note=0add8a5835559b4b\" title=\"18-df-well-order-enumeration\">18-df-well-order-enumeration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"83adc13498d19c2f\" href=\"?note=83adc13498d19c2f\" title=\"18-df-normal-function\">18-df-normal-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Definition 3.4.6; Theorem 3.4.7"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"36–37"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"46–47"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^\\beta\">\\(\\omega^\\beta\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5c52eb8a9d5ba532\" href=\"?note=5c52eb8a9d5ba532\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-exponentiation\">18-df-ordinal-exponentiation</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fix}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fix}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Enum}\">\\(\\mathrm{Enum}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"779baa2ce0d8c0d8\" href=\"?note=779baa2ce0d8c0d8\" title=\"18-df-fixed-point-set\">18-df-fixed-point-set</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0add8a5835559b4b\" href=\"?note=0add8a5835559b4b\" title=\"18-df-well-order-enumeration\">18-df-well-order-enumeration</a>。下列递归定义可定义类图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}^3\">\\(\\varphi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}^3\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_\\alpha(\\beta)\">\\(\\varphi_\\alpha(\\beta)\\)</span> 表示其唯一值；下标与参数均为序数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_0(\\beta)\\coloneqq\\omega^\\beta\\qquad(\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varphi_0(\\beta)\\coloneqq\\omega^\\beta\\qquad(\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_\\alpha\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Enum}\\!\\left(\\{\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\mid\n\\forall\\gamma&lt;\\alpha\\;(\\varphi_\\gamma(\\xi)=\\xi)\\}\\right)\n\\qquad(0&lt;\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varphi_\\alpha\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Enum}\\!\\left(\\{\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\mid\n\\forall\\gamma&lt;\\alpha\\;(\\varphi_\\gamma(\\xi)=\\xi)\\}\\right)\n\\qquad(0&lt;\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 Definition 3.4.6 与 Theorem 3.4.7。原书先递归定义 Cr(α) 的导类，再取 en；这里对非零 α 直接枚举所有较低层的共同不动点，系等价展开。后继层仅取前层不动点已经蕴含较低层不动点；极限层取交。类层递归在每个集合大小初段进行；任取足够大的正则 κ，原书的 club 交与导类定理确保共同不动点无界、闭且枚举全域，局部构造由唯一性相容。不将待定义 φ 预先当作已存在的正规族。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-exponentiation","status":"resolved","id":"5c52eb8a9d5ba532","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-fixed-point-set","status":"resolved","id":"779baa2ce0d8c0d8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-fixed-point-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-well-order-enumeration","status":"resolved","id":"0add8a5835559b4b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-well-order-enumeration]]","embed":fa